  "comments": "<p>The first consignment of Namibian coins arrived at Walvis Bay on 13 November 1993, with official issuance to commercial banks commencing on 8 December 1993. The inaugural coin series included denominations of 5c, 10c, 50c, N$1.00, and N$5.00, each featuring designs inspired by Namibia’s rich fauna and flora. &nbsp;An uncirculated 1993 First Coinage booklet was issued, containing all five denominations, the exact number of these sets remains unknown.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67c56881a8539.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67c56881a8539.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67c56886b82a0.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67c56886b82a0.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67c5688b9b502.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67c5688b9b502.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For 1996 2 different edge varieties exist<br><br><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/573d637a79e39.jpg\" alt=\"\"><br><strong>Coarse reeding </strong>(above) and <strong>fine reeding</strong> (below)<br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5e6f34292d9d0.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5e6f34292d9d0.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bateleur\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bateleur</a></p>",
